    !---------------------------------------------
    ! hipMemPoolExportToShareableHandle
    !---------------------------------------------
    !>  @brief Exports a memory pool to the requested handle type.
    !>
    !>  Given an IPC capable mempool, create an OS handle to share the pool with another process.
