  !>   @param[in]  src Data being copy from
  !>   @param[in]  sizeBytes Data size in bytes
  !>   @param[in]  myKind  Type of memory transfer
  !>   @param[in]  stream  Stream identifier
  !>   @returns `hipSuccess`, `hipErrorInvalidValue`, `hipErrorUnknown`
